{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_016_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:34380cc1578dc8e63f0cf8e35e2e0503e3af589bd278d705cfc98268be2a3091",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_016_23:5_01_016_23_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4856d79f5ba52e430e06d68cf8b27df93077bb6698ea4e0f391ee0fc69efcc9",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n从这里开始路况变差了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_016_23:5_01_016_23_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e207e6a0e450990ea256fe3c173f4b706f582607231ed701f39f8361593351e",
      "text": "我们步行前往目的地的小木屋咖啡厅吧。\n从这里走的话大概5分钟左右就能到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_016_23:5_01_016_23_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4356203da726b2dca99a8846f5aeb43511df1e8254ca19c9abfc29bb5fdc319f",
      "text": "明白了。很期待诚司先生推荐的店呢。\n能拍出很棒的视频就好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_016_23:5_01_016_23_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:affe9162f8c7780e29d09e27c5fe521f549e8b2ab42c6732e386d215db705082",
      "text": "嗯，那是一家风景和菜品都非常出色的店。\n粉丝们肯定也会喜欢的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_016_23:5_01_016_23_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:524de0e2ae0a032effcb3f81cc20989e6166362bbe5509e3983703757266ee89",
      "text": "我们要不要把这一带的景色也拍进视频里呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_016_23:5_01_016_23_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4883c1b278123a517a6ee787318f88fb0b623839c548b101ed1f9a391afd83f",
      "text": "是啊。但在那之前有句话我想对你说。\n……前几天的情人节巧克力，谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_016_23:5_01_016_23_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33498bea3408e830ef2f8171c42411f07c52180355c9ca46c0a0c0d52de66a0e",
      "text": "非常美味。是因为里面倾注了制作人的\n热情吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_016_23:5_01_016_23_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ad4ca0d188940e3546c06c3ff631ffc49fb399220f7a1d99a2c718c2c332fa1",
      "text": "吃了巧克力的那天工作时，\n发挥出了超乎平时的力量呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_016_23:5_01_016_23_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e22f468254ee7a922e30cd11204753dcdcca6dc663bebb3d9bc6ecef920ffa8",
      "text": "原来是这样啊。\n能帮上你的忙，我也很高兴！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_016_23:5_01_016_23_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b3b1008df6aeface62a034d142884f6a577be1b7826d5fec60640f6c2414a8f",
      "text": "白色情人节的时候，请让我重新向你道谢吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
